            ('Time basis', 'Zeitbasis'), ('Local civil time', 'Lokale Zeit'), ('Fixed UTC offset', 'Fester UTC-Offset'),
            ('What each row represents', 'Was jede Zeile darstellt'), ('Key fields', 'Wichtige Felder'), ('Why it matters', 'Warum das wichtig ist'),
